WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:11.120
From a single seed to a family’s dining table; from a field to the lives of thousands of households. Every effort in agriculture deserves thoughtful attention.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:16.880
Huahai AgriTech: bringing technology closer to agriculture, and making quality more visible.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:29.472
Shenzhen Huahai AgriTech Group Co., Ltd., founded in 2017. As a Shenzhen-based enterprise supporting Xinjiang development, Huahai anchors itself in agriculture and drives

00:00:29.472 --> 00:00:37.600
progress with AI, connecting technology R&D, production services, trade circulation, and industrial collaboration.

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:50.153
Spanning crop cultivation, livestock and aquaculture, and extending into processing, food R&D, and data services, Huahai AgriTech is exploring industrial connectivity from field to

00:00:50.153 --> 00:00:50.560
table.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:01:01.364
Agriculture involves more than just production. Efforts in the field need to be understood by the market; market needs deserve to be heard by origins. Connecting these two ends is

00:01:01.364 --> 00:01:04.800
where Huahai begins its thinking on industrial development.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:16.218
For producers, we focus on management and supply; for merchants, on product representation and logistics collaboration; for households, on information, choice, and

00:01:16.218 --> 00:01:23.120
service. Connecting these needs through technology is Huahai AgriTech’s ongoing development direction.

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:33.400
Advancing agriculture with technology, enabling with AI, prioritizing food safety. This is Huahai AgriTech’s commitment

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:44.679
The value of technology lies in the field, in the water, and in every authentic production and service interaction. Observing environmental changes, documenting farming activities, valuing

00:01:44.679 --> 00:01:48.200
product origin and quality—each step reflects greater care.

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:58.810
Advancing agriculture with technology means bringing tools directly to where they are truly needed — enabling frontline personnel to understand production processes more easily, and

00:01:58.810 --> 00:02:02.640
allowing daily accumulated experience to create value alongside data

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:12.511
AI empowerment means making complex information easier to understand. Facing diverse crops, varied farming environments, and differing consumer demands, technology should

00:02:12.511 --> 00:02:15.360
support people in making better-informed decisions.

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:27.305
‘Food safety first’ means placing attention to quality at every step of production, processing, and distribution—from source documentation to batch information, from product descriptions

00:02:27.305 --> 00:02:32.280
to after-sales service—treating each product with care, and each family with care.

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:46.029
On the farm or in aquaculture settings, sensors and intelligent gateways help observe changes in fields and water bodies; on the data platform, artificial intelligence helps organize

00:02:46.029 --> 00:02:49.360
information to support management decisions and selection.

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:59.600
Let data and professional expertise work in tandem — making agricultural technology a helper for cultivation, livestock farming, and industry services

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:10.151
Connecting on-site operations with the platform forms the foundation of this approach. Organizing fragmented information—from fields and ponds to business processes—enables

00:03:10.151 --> 00:03:12.920
clearer grounding for industrial collaboration.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:24.300
Beyond agriculture and food, Huahai AgriTech also explores synthetic biology, agricultural product processing, and trusted information services—balancing attention to digital

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:29.320
technologies with attention to raw materials, products, and the industry itself.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:38.858
We hope that as technology enters agriculture, what remains is not a string of obscure terms—but clearer processes, more evidence-based judgments, and smoother

00:03:38.858 --> 00:03:41.520
communication between people and the industry.

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:55.000
Starting from the origin, agriculture must also enter daily life. Aimaimai is Huahai AgriTech’s key product vehicle connecting agricultural products, merchants, and consumers.

00:03:55.480 --> 00:04:05.358
The Buyer App and WeChat Mini Program help consumers learn about products and express purchasing needs—linking shopping and services. The Seller and Management Backends

00:04:05.358 --> 00:04:09.800
coordinate merchants and platforms around products, orders, and fulfillment.

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:19.320
Search for products, view supporting information, or describe what you’d like to buy using natural language. Clearer information connects you with more suitable options.

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:28.836
Facing three daily meals, consumers often ask: What is this product? What are its specifications? Where does it come from? Does it meet my selection criteria? Product

00:04:28.836 --> 00:04:35.360
documentation, batch information, and service access points serve as the starting point for addressing these questions.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:46.113
Facing daily operations, merchants need to clearly articulate their products, organize specifications and inventory effectively, and align orders with fulfillment. Aimaimai provides

00:04:46.113 --> 00:04:51.280
foundational agricultural e-commerce products and business infrastructure around these steps.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:05:00.590
For the platform, merchant and product review, order operations, and service coordination jointly support the transaction process. Buyers, merchants, and the platform each fulfill

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:03.800
distinct roles while collaborating along the same service chain.

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:12.273
AI can assist in interpreting search and purchasing requests—connecting a natural-language statement to product queries and corresponding services. This brings technology into

00:05:12.273 --> 00:05:16.040
everyday use while making operations more aligned with human expression habits.

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:29.183
From production records to grading, quality control, and packaging; from commodity transactions to delivery fulfillment and consumer feedback. Huahai is exploring a

00:05:29.183 --> 00:05:33.600
collaborative model across the full AI-powered production-to-sales chain.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:45.435
Let real demand inform supply organization; let production and product information help express quality; let consumer feedback support the next cycle of product selection, inventory

00:05:45.435 --> 00:05:47.760
preparation, and industry improvement

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:57.222
Imagine a journey for an aquaculture product: beginning with farming records from the pond, proceeding through grading and testing to generate batch and packaging documentation,

00:05:57.222 --> 00:06:01.160
then moving via merchant and transaction services to the family dining table.

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:12.113
Consumers prioritize specifications, taste, and service; merchants prioritize order fulfillment; origin sites prioritize subsequent supply arrangements. Structuring these pieces of

00:06:12.113 --> 00:06:17.400
information enables reference for the next round of product portfolio and supply planning.

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:28.249
This is the industry collaboration Huahai AgriTech aims to build progressively: connecting supply to authentic demand; using production and product documentation to express quality;

00:06:28.249 --> 00:06:36.960
and supporting continuous improvement through ongoing feedback. AI assists in understanding information, organizing needs, and generating suggestions.

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:51.169
Huahai’s AI-driven agriculture/food/wellbeing ecosystem is grounded in agriculture and food, focusing on origin production, food quality, nutritional information, and daily

00:06:51.169 --> 00:06:52.520
consumption services.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:07:02.929
From green inputs and farm management, to food R&D and processing, and finally to household dining tables. Huahai seeks to collaborate with agricultural bases, food

00:07:02.929 --> 00:07:09.960
enterprises, research institutions, and industry partners to explore connections between technology and daily life.

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:20.450
For households, the Agriculture-Food-Wellbeing Ecosystem begins with understanding food—knowing ingredients and origins, interpreting product labels and nutritional data, and

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:24.560
gradually forming personalized points of attention in everyday choices.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:36.886
For the industry, this is a pathway connecting agricultural production, food R&D, processing, and consumer services—ensuring raw material value is rigorously studied, product

00:07:36.886 --> 00:07:42.640
information is clearly communicated, and daily life needs are consistently addressed.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:54.673
This ecosystem pathway requires long-term development and joint participation by industry partners. Huahai AgriTech aims to connect source production, product R&D, and household

00:07:54.673 --> 00:08:02.280
consumption through technology and industry collaboration—step by step—to bring agriculture closer to a better life.

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:14.760
Advancing agriculture with technology, enabling with AI, prioritizing food safety. Huahai AgriTech — connecting agriculture to a better life, together with you
